; effect4_engine_cas — the on-disk CAS: the byte layer (crc, kinds, addresses, the node
; envelope), then the pack, the index, the control file, the WAL, checkpoints and the caches
; (docs/research/2026-09-08-engine-a2-persistence.md §3; lanes P0-P10).  Flat: one e4_*.ml per
; module with its .mli and a Behaviours list at its head (ocaml/STANDARDS.md §2); tests in
; test/.  A sub-library of the engine's dune project (ocaml/engine/dune-project); it declares
; no dune-project of its own.
;
; Dependencies: the stdlib, unix (the file classes lanes P1/P3/P5 land), effect4_engine for
; E4_sha256 / E4_hex / E4_be (never a second hash and never a second framing writer -- brief
; §2.2), and effect4_eff for Eff_frame's tag alphabet and UTF-8 rule (read-only).
(library
 (name effect4_engine_cas)
 (libraries unix effect4_engine effect4_eff)
 (flags (:standard -w +a-4-9-40-41-42-44-45-70)))
